@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@claimId = REPLACE_WITH_A_REAL_CLAIM_ID
@studentNumber = ST2026001

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Submit a valid claim (expected 201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentNumber": "{{studentNumber}}",
  "firstName": "Thando",
  "surname": "Mokoena",
  "hoursWorked": 12.5
}

### Search recent claims by student number (expected 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/claims/student/{{studentNumber}}

### Retrieve one claim by ID (replace @claimId first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/claims/{{claimId}}

### Cancel a Pending claim (expected 200 OK)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/claims/{{claimId}}/cancel

### Cancel the same claim again (expected 409 Conflict)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/claims/{{claimId}}/cancel

### Prove server-controlled fields cannot be supplied (expected 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentNumber": "ST2026002",
  "firstName": "Lebo",
  "surname": "Nkosi",
  "hoursWorked": 5,
  "hourlyRate": 999,
  "status": "Approved"
}
